# UX workflow: create a Track directly, extend its Page structure, and replay history.
# Purpose: validates frictionless Track creation, contiguous Pages, and that
# Undo/Redo restores both domain state and the visible active Track/Page.
# This subsumes the former isolated structure-track-redo-ui workflow.
# Expect: capture_match:page_2_creation_undone=track_2_creation_redone, capture_changed:page_2_creation_undone=track_2_creation_undone, capture_match:page_2_created=page_2_creation_redone

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen track_1_pattern_1

# Open Structure and create Track 2 from the sole +Track slot. Confirmation is
# atomic and returns directly to its musical grid (Page 1, eight steps).
150 button NAV down
210 encoder NAV -1
270 button NAV up
330 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
1280 capture screen structure_tracks_open
1530 encoder NAV 1
1730 capture screen track_2_add_preview
1830 tap NAV 60
2180 capture screen track_2_pattern_1

# Select Pattern with the common NAV hold-turn-release gesture, open its
# retained editor with a NAV tap, then use the first-rank +Page action. Page
# authoring no longer descends through the Track-only Structure workspace.
2280 button NAV down
2340 encoder NAV 1
2400 button NAV up
2580 tap NAV 60
2880 capture screen track_2_pattern_editor
3080 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
3300 tap LEFT_TOP 60
4430 capture screen page_2_created

# Undo Page 2: the visible surface must return to Track 2 / Page 1.
5160 tap LEFT_TOP 60
6230 tick
6290 capture screen selector_undo_pattern_ready
6340 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
6470 capture screen selector_undo_track_ready
6520 tap LEFT_TOP 60
7900 capture screen page_2_creation_undone

# Undo Track 2: the active UI must return to Track 1.
8000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
9070 tick
9130 capture screen selector_undo_track_ready_again
9180 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
9310 capture screen selector_redo_track_ready
9360 tap LEFT_TOP 60
10740 capture screen track_2_creation_undone

# Redo Track 2, then Page 2. Both domain and focused UI must be restored.
10840 tap LEFT_TOP 60
11910 tick
11970 capture screen selector_redo_track_ready_again
12020 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
12150 capture screen selector_redo_pattern_ready
12200 tap LEFT_TOP 60
13580 capture screen track_2_creation_redone

13680 tap LEFT_TOP 60
14750 tick
14810 capture screen selector_redo_pattern_ready_again
14860 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
14990 capture screen selector_undo_pattern_ready_restored
15040 tap LEFT_TOP 60
16420 capture screen page_2_creation_redone
